                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 20.0, 20.0, 420.0, 100.0 ],
                    "text": "mUnit Glossary: how it works. The words live in misc/mUnit-glossary.json, which the [dict] at the bottom loads from the package when this patch opens; nothing in this patch is generated. To add a term, edit the JSON: it appears here at once and, after pnpm run glossary, at the end of README.md.\n\n1. On load: fill the category menu from the names in the categories array, then choose the first category."
                }
            },
